WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.100
- Well, speaking of the outdoors,

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:03.590
your husband is obsessed
with just animals.

00:00:03.590 --> 00:00:04.423
- Yes.

00:00:04.423 --> 00:00:05.467
- How many do you have?

00:00:05.467 --> 00:00:07.040
You don't like animals.

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:07.873
(laughs)

00:00:07.873 --> 00:00:08.878
- No, I love, I love animals.

00:00:08.878 --> 00:00:10.450
But he has reptiles.

00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:14.240
So, he has like 45 to 50
reptiles that live underneath us.

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:15.830
No snakes, that was the deal.

00:00:15.830 --> 00:00:16.663
I said no snakes,

00:00:16.663 --> 00:00:19.763
but so, when we actually dated
a little over a decade ago,

00:00:19.763 --> 00:00:23.040
I knew that I was marrying
a guy who loves reptiles.

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:23.873
You know what I mean?

00:00:23.873 --> 00:00:24.980
So, it was fine.

00:00:24.980 --> 00:00:25.813
I said as so long as--

00:00:25.813 --> 00:00:26.820
- That's a lot, that's 40 to 50?

00:00:26.820 --> 00:00:27.653
- Yeah.

00:00:27.653 --> 00:00:28.486
- Wow.

00:00:28.486 --> 00:00:30.580
- Iguanas is like, that
looked like alligators.

00:00:30.580 --> 00:00:31.650
- Do you have a dog?

00:00:31.650 --> 00:00:32.700
- Yes, A little Frenchie.

00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:34.050
She's my little baby.

00:00:34.050 --> 00:00:35.960
So I'm like stay far away.

00:00:35.960 --> 00:00:39.380
Yes, so she's an indoorsy type dog.

00:00:39.380 --> 00:00:42.340
Likes to go on walks, but
stays away from the cages.

00:00:42.340 --> 00:00:44.080
- Okay okay, stays from the cages

00:00:44.080 --> 00:00:45.342
sounds like a great place.

00:00:45.342 --> 00:00:47.420
(laughs)

00:00:47.420 --> 00:00:49.530
Your partner on Dancing
with the Stars last season

00:00:49.530 --> 00:00:52.530
was Cody Rigsby, he was here last year.

00:00:52.530 --> 00:00:54.120
So what was he like as a partner?

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:54.980
- Oh, he's amazing.

00:00:54.980 --> 00:00:56.480
I mean, he's so inspirational.

00:00:56.480 --> 00:00:57.313
- So joyful.

00:00:57.313 --> 00:00:59.740
- He's so joyful, but
he's also a hard worker,

00:00:59.740 --> 00:01:01.670
like he worked seven days a week.

00:01:01.670 --> 00:01:03.330
He wanted to get the routines right.

00:01:03.330 --> 00:01:05.010
And it didn't come easy.

00:01:05.010 --> 00:01:07.390
And I just saw so many
different sides to Cody.

00:01:07.390 --> 00:01:09.240
Like he is this like bubbly person,

00:01:09.240 --> 00:01:11.840
but he also has a real
human side to him too,

00:01:11.840 --> 00:01:13.690
which was refreshing for sure.

